msgid "What renews on each day of the month, with each day's renewal cost in your currency. Only live domains, hosting services, and SSL certificates are shown. Expired and sold domains, cancelled hosting services, and expired SSL certificates are left out. Hosting services' dates are projected renewals, so a monthly service appears on each day it renews."
